<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have charged a former state attorney general with treason over alleged U.S. involvement in a drug raid, and arrested an alleged cartel leader linked to a deadly car bombing. A Texas man was indicted for purchasing firearms in Amarillo to supply the Sinaloa Cartel, while a Sinaloa Cartel transporter pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana. A Hells Angels boss was arrested in Cancún, marking a second biker bust in 2026, and a fifth suspect was indicted for buying guns for the cartel. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNS184aGRfRUFFT0RxSzZLUHEzX2hsbnBKV3hmbEZvY1RvTjZqSkJRd3J0bWJmeVVUVmNWV0dZekNSOWtyNE1XZXhRSmtvaTVOV3k0SjZ5OXFwVldhQTY1M1dPX3V4bnRvWTEzT3hMQjRPMTBuX28wTjE3VHNkQWY0YmxSNTVLT3ZIWFdsVlhQQlhTTTlKc1lCM0hQUjZRMjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE03RnZsbXlOMzRUb29RMHJYc1E2N1h2WmNwODdJWmhfYlJEUGN4R0ZZdEF0VEdHMEppN3ZUbWJCaXJtR0Y5Nzl3V0JIZG9yRGs0S3FxMlFxcHUzaUtnVHF1YXVZeHptWFNaSHRRMmlxMjhXUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CrashOut by Ioan Grillo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNa0